        "ha": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Launi na fifiko yana sake canza launin zaɓi da ci gaba a duk faɗin manhajar. OLED Black yana amfani da baƙi na gaskiya, mafi kyau a kan fuskokin AMOLED."
