        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibara ry'ingenzi ryongera gushyira amabara ku byahiswemo n'aho bigeze muri porogaramu yose. OLED Black ikoresha umukara nyawo, ikaba nziza cyane kuri AMOLED panels."
