        "mi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ka tuwhera tika ngā awa tōtika me ngā awa debrid ki tō pūtangi kua kōwhiria, ā, māna e whakahaere te pāho me te haere-tonu. Ka whakamahi tonu ngā torrent, ngā pūtake kua tiakina-e-te-pane, me ngā tīra i te pūtangi tāroto."
