            "value": "XRDB (extendedratings.com) ishyira amanota aturuka ku nkomoko zigera kuri 12, ibimenyetso by'ubwiza, n'ibirango by'abatanga streaming ku mafoto yawe y'amamenyekanisha n'imbuganyuma. Koresha XRDB yawe bwite cyangwa ukoreshe iyacumbikiwe, ushyireho aderesi yayo n'irihimbano ry'umwirondoro wawe, maze VortX izana ubuhanzi bwayo hose. Bidategetswe, kandi ntibifitanye isano na debrid."
